   "items": [
    {
     "title": "DESIGNED FOR THE OCEAN",
     "text": "The great autonomy of the SIXTY 7 enables you to plan longer crossings, offering the perfect balance for you to travel the world."
    },
    {
     "title": "THE ELEGANCE OF SPACE",
     "text": "Adjoining living spaces connect the interior and exterior, revealing the best of both worlds and taking maximum advantage of natural lighting."
    },
    {
     "title": "FREEDOM OF THE FLYBRIDGE",
     "text": "Discover the flybridge, where everything has been designed for you to feel free.  Open to the natural environment for a stunning view, the versatile layout will meet your every expectation.\nFor the captain and crew, the helm station has been designed to facilitate handling."
    },
    {
     "title": "HOME AWAY FROM HOME",
     "text": "A major strength of the SIXTY 7 is the owner’s suite.  The large walk-in closet, spacious bathroom and bedroom are worthy of the finest hotels."
    }
   ],
